---
import { generateGeneralInquiryUrl } from '../../utils/whatsapp';

const waConsultUrl = generateGeneralInquiryUrl('value-highlights');
---

<section class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-white border-b border-zinc-200/80 font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-8 sm:mb-12 pb-6 border-b border-zinc-100 gap-4">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">
          Mengapa Memilih Agro Prima Greenhouse?
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
          Standar Konstruksi Presisi &amp; Komitmen Lapangan
        </h2>
      </div>
      <a
        href={waConsultUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors shrink-0"
      >
        <span>Konsultasi Proyek Anda</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Core Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Pilar 01</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-1.5">Workshop &amp; Kantor Fisik Jelas</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Anda dapat datang langsung ke workshop kami di Kedungkandang, Kota Malang untuk mengecek sampel material rangka dan berdiskusi teknis secara langsung.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400">
          Transparansi Lokasi &amp; Legalitas
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Pilar 02</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-1.5">Pilihan Struktur Lengkap</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Mulai dari pipa galvanis komersial, baja ringan presisi, bambu awet ekonomis, hingga spesialis tunnel kristalisasi garam meja anti-hujan.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400">
          Disesuaikan Target Anggaran Anda
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Pilar 03</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-1.5">Konsultasi Teknis &amp; RAB Gratis</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Diskusikan dimensi lahan, komoditas tanaman, arah angin, dan kalkulasi estimasi kebutuhan biaya per m² secara transparan sebelum memulai proyek.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400">
          Perencanaan Matang Sejak Awal
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a1 1 0 001 1h2m9 0H9m10 0h2a1 1 0 001-1v-3.65a1 1 0 00-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0017.52 8H14M17 18a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4zm-10 0a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Pilar 04</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-1.5">Kirim &amp; Pasang Se-Indonesia</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Didukung jaringan ekspedisi kargo terpercaya dan tim teknisi yang siap diberangkatkan untuk perakitan langsung di lokasi lahan Anda.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400">
          Jangkauan Nasional Dari Sabang - Merauke
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Pilar 05</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-1.5">Material Berstandar Mutu</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Hanya menggunakan plastik UV 200µm 14% anti-drip, paranet rajut kuat, dan kuncian profil spring clip presisi yang awet terkena panas hujan.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400">
          Ketahanan Fisik Maksimal
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Extra Card: CTA Prompt -->
      <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/60 border border-emerald-200/80 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-2xs">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Mulai Sekarang</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-1.5">Siap Bangun Greenhouse?</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Kirimkan ukuran lahan Anda ke tim kami untuk mendapatkan rancangan konsep dan estimasi biaya gratis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3.5 mt-4 border-t border-emerald-200/60">
          <a
            href={waConsultUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
          >
            <span>Hubungi via WhatsApp</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
